    "u_2831546121359362": "Manual setup",
    "u_90c0c34d801fdd9c": "No provider connection is configured.",
    "u_77525ef1bd4ad8a2": "Run a rehearsal now",
    "u_23693ad03ec29c90": "Runs one rehearsal incident per risk category against this deployment's real wiring. A safe step executes, a consequential step must pause, the approver is notified through the real channel, and an audit trail is produced. Nothing consequential can execute — the dangerous step is required to pause.",
    "u_28100fcd551b3b32": "Rehearsal",
    "u_cb34e90b5739f252": "This is a rehearsal, not a production repair. It proves the gating, notification and audit path work here. It is not evidence that a real incident was fixed.",
    "u_5b0015fd075f755a": "Run rehearsal",
    "u_44499e90e51f39da": "Real notifications are being sent. This takes a few seconds.",
    "u_cfce761befa84073": "Request failed",
    "u_eb76c07d7a0d2231": "The request did not complete",
    "u_cc672a8a17a0ef3f": "Audit events",
    "u_3b301f5885682323": "Notifications sent",
    "u_4b4c31294fb5b71b": "Run at",
    "u_abf4903ad7669248": "Raise a drill incident",
    "u_3ba49267395e4e68": "Sends a synthetic incident through the same path a monitoring alert takes: signed webhook, authentication, deduplication, storage, triage, and the policy engine. Nothing is stubbed and nothing is bypassed.",
    "u_0e2113782a3d0373": "Drill",
    "u_c03ac3d56b3ba559": "No repair is executed. This deployment configures no execution step runner, so the run ends unresolved and records why, rather than claiming a fix that did not happen.",
    "u_694c2e9870bbe98b": "Raise drill incident",
    "u_f0112a0a0e57c590": "Delivering…",
    "u_de701adeff836886": "The incident is being authenticated, stored and diagnosed.",
